                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Equipment: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>The total number of racks and shelves present in the store.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'># of Shelves:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The total number of shelves present for each rack &amp; shelf.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Area Sq cm:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> calculated by multiplying the depth and width of the equipment.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Total Sq cm:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> The total area in square centimeters, calculated by multiplying the area of each equipment unit with the number of equipment units and shelves.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>Area Sqm:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>  calculated by multiplying Total Sq cm with 0.0001.</run>
